{
  "_about": "Shared FramePayload conformance cases. Read by rust/src/payload.rs, go/pkg/nrv/payload_test.go, ts/src/components/storage/nrv/payload.test.ts and KNIRVMODELS/pkg/training/nrvtrainer. expect=ok: decode, validate, encode must equal canonical (compared as parsed JSON values, so integer-valued floats match). expect=error: decode or validate must fail. Widths: tokens/start u32, brackets u16 with frame cap 1024, tier u8 with tool tier set 0..=3 (0 execute, 1 ask, 2 deny, 3 escalate). Boxes are normalised: x, y, w, h finite and in 0..=1, with x+w <= 1 and y+h <= 1 (1e-9 tolerance). Embedding values finite.",
